  "description": "CR 715.2b, 715.2c, 603.7b, 508.3a, 611.2a: Summon: Leviathan's chapter I returns every creature that isn't a Kraken, Leviathan, Merfolk, Octopus or Serpent to its owner's hand, and its chapter II draws a card for each such creature that attacks until end of turn",
